sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant G as LangGraph
    participant M as Memory
    participant D as Decision gate
    participant Q as Qwen planner
    participant T as Catalog tools
    participant S as Qwen selector
    participant V as Gemma validator
    U->>G: query, user_id, k
    G->>M: recall(user_id)
    G->>D: choice and confidence
    D-->>G: small or modern route
    G->>Q: typed plan
    Q-->>G: genres and exclusions
    G->>T: retrieve and filter
    T-->>S: candidates with evidence
    S->>V: selected IDs and genres
    V-->>G: verdict
    alt rejected once
      G->>S: repair with errors
      S->>V: revised selection
    end
    G->>M: save episode with TTL
    G-->>U: verified result or catalog fallback
